      "shortDescription": "WedPlan is a full-stack wedding planning platform where customers browse and book wedding services, vendors manage their services and bookings, and admins control the whole platform. It has role-based dashboards for Customer, Vendor and Admin, a complete booking system, Stripe Premium vendor plans activated only after verified webhook events, and a JWT-secured API verified against the Better Auth JWKS endpoint.",
      "features": [
        "Secure authentication with Better Auth (email/password and Google login)",
        "Role-based access for Customer, Vendor and Admin with separate dashboards",
        "JWT-protected API verified against the Better Auth JWKS endpoint",
        "Server-side role verification (verifyToken + requireRole middleware, 401/403)",
        "Private routes protected by a proxy with redirect back after login",
        "Persistent login on page reload, including production dashboard routes",
        "Role-based redirect to the correct dashboard after login",
        "Blocked-user enforcement: blocked accounts cannot open the dashboard or book",
        "Home page with banner, Featured Services (6 latest approved from MongoDB), Wedding Categories, How It Works, Why Choose WedPlan and Customer Testimonials",
        "Browse Services with search by name, category filter, location filter and price sort (low to high / high to low)",
        "Service Details page with image gallery, vendor card with Premium badge and booking form",
        "Booking system: customers send booking requests, vendors accept or reject, customers can cancel pending requests",
        "Duplicate active booking prevention for the same service and event date",
        "Own-service booking blocked for vendors; admin accounts cannot book",
        "Vendor dashboard: overview stats, Add Service with ImgBB image upload, My Services (update/delete), Booking Requests with customer information",
        "Free vendor limit: maximum 3 active services; Premium vendors get unlimited services",
        "Stripe Checkout Premium plan (BDT 4,999 / 30 days) activated only after verified Stripe webhook",
        "Idempotent webhook handling with a unique stripeSessionId index (no duplicate transactions)",
        "Admin dashboard: platform stats (users, vendors, customers, services, bookings, revenue), Manage Users (block/unblock), Manage Services (search, approve/reject/delete), Transactions (view only)",
        "Profile settings with ImgBB profile image upload",
        "Toast notifications for all success and error messages (no alert())",
        "Loading spinners and custom 404 page",
        "Fully responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)",
        "Password validation (min 8 chars, uppercase and lowercase)"
      ],
      "keyTechnologies": [
        "Express.js",
